    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50838" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vīcēsĭmārĭus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to the twentieth
			part.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Adj.</i>: aurum, <i>of the tax
			called</i> vicesima (v. h. v.), <i><span class="en">Liv. 27,
				10, 11</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
